### 4.6 Test Environments
- Integration/Staging environment with Jira API connectivity or controllable Jira API simulation
- Mock service or stub for 401 Unauthorized and missing description
- Credential matrix for valid, invalid, expired, and missing tokens
- Log capture/monitoring access

