| PyTest       | API/service validation, error handling  | Functional, Regression            |
| JMeter       | SLA/Performance simulation              | Performance                       |
| OWASP ZAP    | Security validation                     | Security                          |
| tcconfig     | Network condition simulation            | Negative, Performance             |

