## 5. Quality Objectives
- Validate Jira API authentication
- Handle missing or inaccessible issue descriptions gracefully

---

## 6. Test Schedule / Milestone
| Phase                | Start Date | End Date   | Resource(s)         |
|----------------------|------------|------------|---------------------|
| Test Planning        | <T0>       | <T0+2d>    | QA Lead             |
| Environment Setup    | <T0+2d>    | <T0+4d>    | DevOps, QA          |
| Script Development   | <T0+4d>    | <T0+8d>    | SDET, QA            |
| Test Execution      | <T0+8d>    | <T0+12d>   | QA, SDET            |
| Reporting & Closure  | <T0+12d>   | <T0+14d>   | QA Lead, Release Mgr|

---

## 7. Assumptions
- Test team has access to Jira API simulation or mock service
- Credential matrix can be configured for all required states
- Logging and monitoring tools are available
- No requirement extraction from inaccessible issues is expected

---

## 8. Resource Estimate
- 1 QA Lead (planning, reporting)
- 1 SDET (automation, scripting)
- 1 DevOps (environment setup)
- 1 QA Analyst (manual/negative testing)
- Estimated duration: 2 weeks

---

## 9. Risk Mitigation Table
| Risk ID | Risk Description | Impact | Probability | Severity | Mitigation Action | Owner |
|---------|------------------|--------|-------------|----------|-------------------|-------|
| R1      | Dynamic Jira API endpoint changes or downtime | High   | Medium      | High     | Use mock/stub service for test continuity; monitor endpoint health | QA Lead |
| R2      | Credential matrix not covering all negative cases | Medium | Medium      | Medium   | Review and expand credential scenarios; automate token generation | SDET |
| R3      | Log capture/monitoring unavailable or incomplete | Medium | Low         | Medium   | Coordinate with DevOps for log access; add fallback logging | DevOps |
| R4      | Timeline delays due to environment provisioning | Medium | Medium      | Medium   | Early environment request; parallelize setup with planning | QA Lead |
| R5      | Test data not representative of real-world failures | Medium | Low        | Medium   | Use production-like data in mocks; review with stakeholders | QA Analyst |

